  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring, Advocacy and Legal Advice Centre (MALAC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to mobilise citizens in anticorruption efforts and increase transparency and accountability of judiciary by: empowering citizens to report corruption and acting towards institutions to ensure that citizens reports are addressed; building student networks and youth initiatives in the field of anti-corruption; and strengthening oversight of prosecution of corruption through monitoring trials of corruption, holding judiciary accountable in prosecuting public officials.</narrative>
  </description>
